• Currently possesses and is able to maintain an active U.S. Top Secret security clearance

• Experience with RF chamber measurements and network analyzers

• 2+ years experience with HFSS

• 2+ years in antenna design or integration. The more the better

• 5+ years in relevant Science and/or Engineering related field

